<p>Here is a block equation representing the softmax function:</p>

\[\sigma(\mathbf{z})_i = \frac{e^{z_i}}{\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}}\]

<p>And here is an inline equation: $E = mc^2$.</p>
